description: A seat on a downstream checkout (fork, mirror, an organisation running the tree as its own) never reads the upstream repository's surfaces without the owner's permission and never writes to them; every call names the checkout's own repository explicitly; the PR base is the repository's default branch, derived, never a literal.
alwaysApply: true
